  "description": "Identifies traders exhibiting both high risk-adjusted turnover and a high suspicious activity index.",
  "definition": "A trader with a high Risk-Adjusted Turnover (RAT)  (e.g., > 1.0) AND a high Suspicious Activity Index (SAI)  (e.g., > 0.6)."
}

{
