  "knowledge": "Confirmed Evasive Layering/Spoofing",
  "description": "Identifies traders confirmed to be layering or spoofing who also exhibit high cancellation/modification behavior, suggesting deliberate evasion.",
  "definition": "A trader flagged as a High Cancellation/Modification Trader  AND confirmed via Market Manipulation Pattern: Layering/Spoofing  where `risk_indicators.layerind` is 'Confirmed' or `risk_indicators.spoofprob` > 0.75."
}

{
